==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Large White Ball]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Firecracker]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*10 [[Snowball]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snowball]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*10 [[Snowball]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*2 [[Large Iron Ball]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Firecracker]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Large Red Ball]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
*3 [[Large White Ball]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*3 [[Large Red Ball]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*5 [[Firecracker]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The lineup that was used in any of the [[New Year's Bling|previous stages]] can beat it.

